  "et_two_reference_note": "Two unrelated ET products were tested: MODIS MOD16A2GF (satellite retrieval, primary) and TerraClimate (climatic water balance). They agree with each other -- 920 vs 900 mm/yr, and both show the same damped seasonal cycle in SWAT+. Agreement between two independent references makes the finding robust rather than an artefact of one product.",
  "et_aoi_correction_note": "MOD16 was first exported over a bounding box (40,397 km2) rather than the delineated basin (19,915 km2), so about half the sampled pixels lay outside the catchment. Re-exported over the true basin outline, the annual mean moved only 935 -> 920 mm/yr and monthly NSE 0.09 -> 0.14. The correction was methodologically necessary but changed no conclusion -- which is itself evidence the ET finding is not an artefact of how the sampling region was drawn.",
